00:12:19.345 --> 00:12:22.465
Next slide goes over your governmental fund financial highlights.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:29.490
So this includes your general fund on a GAAP basis as well as all of your special revenue and capital project funds.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:34.130
The Town did report combined ending fund balances of approximately $6,100,000

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:37.010
That was an increase of about $957,000

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:37.890
