00:12:38.825 --> 00:12:42.585
In terms of your overall fund balance, approximately 2,100,000,

00:12:42.905 --> 00:12:45.225
was the ending fund balance in the general fund.

00:12:45.785 --> 00:12:47.785
Of that, about 145,

00:12:48.025 --> 00:12:52.025
