00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:56.030
So that left an unassigned fund balance of just over $2,000,000

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.830
and that represents about 15.5%

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:04.350
and is sufficient to cover about one point eight six months of general fund budgetary expenditures.

