>> Can I can I just ask who that letter went to?

00:16:55.005 --> 00:16:56.765
So it goes to town management.

00:16:57.485 --> 00:16:59.725
Town manager. Okay. Yep.

00:17:00.925 --> 00:17:03.005
>> So there were no uncorrected misstatements.

00:17:03.245 --> 00:17:05.005
We had no disagreements,

00:17:05.165 --> 00:17:06.205
with with management.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:11.750
We did obtain a management representation letter. There were no unusual representations that we requested

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:19.510
by us from management. So, for example, I just skip the Board. If we were testing a transaction and we were unable to substantiate that transaction

00:17:20.175 --> 00:17:25.455
through some kind of third party evidence, we would disclose that to you if you were relying on a representation from management.

00:17:26.015 --> 00:17:29.855
And we are not aware of any management consultations with other independent accountants.

00:17:30.015 --> 00:17:33.695
Again, if management did consult with other accountants, we would be required to

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.290
